    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file for checking an image for unsafe or policy-sensitive visual content, I need to choose a concrete external provider that offers image content moderation services. One such provider is Amazon Rekognition, which provides image and video analysis services. I will use the Amazon Rekognition SDK for Python to integrate with the service. The code will include the import of the Boto3 library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, and will call the Amazon Rekognition service to analyze the image. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789889675159,
          "start": 1789889672573
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bdbcf57d001aKUYG9KLW5wvF3",
