        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `describe_image.py` that generates a short visual description for an image using a concrete external provider, I will use the Amazon Rekognition service, which is a part of AWS. This service provides image and video analysis capabilities, including object and scene detection, facial analysis, and text detection. I will import the `boto3` library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, to interact with the Amazon Rekognition service. The code will include the `boto3` import and the use of the `rekognition` client, which are identifiable signals of the Amazon Rekognition service. </thinking>\n",
